<report>
<title>Risk difference meta-analysis</title>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><thfirst>Table (exposed +ve, control +ve, exposed -ve, control -ve)</thfirst><thspan/><thspan/><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="inputs"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>a</in></td><td><in>b</in></td><td><in>c</in></td><td><in>d</in></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Risk difference</th><thfirst><ci><in>pc</in>% CI (<in>method</in>)</ci></thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="differences"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><inu>rd</inu></td><td><ci><inu>lci</inu></ci></td><td><ci><inu>uci</inu></ci></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><thfirst>% Weights (fixed, random)</thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="differences"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><inu>yi</inu></td><td><inu>vi</inu></td><td><inu>wt</inu></td><td><inu>dwt</inu></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr></block>
</table>
<line></line>
<line><u>Fixed effects (Mantel-Haenszel, Greenland-Robins)</u></line>
<line>Pooled risk difference = <inu>rmh</inu> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci>)</line>
<line>Chi<sub>2</sub> (test risk difference differs from 0) = <inu>x2</inu>  (df = <in>df</in>)  <pval><inp>xp</inp></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Non-combinability of studies</u></line>
<line>Cochran Q = <inu>qc</inu>  (df = <in>df_cochran</in>)  <pval><inp>xp_cochran</inp></pval></line>
<line>Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = <inu>tausq</inu></line>
<line>I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = <in>isq</in>% (<ci><in>pc1</in>% CI = <in>llisq</in>% to <in>ulisq</in>%</ci>)</line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u></line>
<line>Pooled risk difference = <inu>dsrd</inu> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>dsll</inu> to <inu>dsul</inu></ci>)</line>
<line>Chi<sub>2</sub> (test risk difference differs from 0) = <inu>dsx2</inu>  (df = <in>df_ds</in>)  <pval><inp>xp_ds</inp></pval></line>
<line></line>
<line><u>Bias indicators</u></line>
<block name="egger">
<line>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's <in>tau</in>  <pval><inp>p2</inp></pval></line>
<line>Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_egger</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><inp>p</inp></pval></line>
</block>
</report>
